<title>UK: TABLE-S&amp;N year pretax profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-S&amp;N year pretax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to April 27, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		45.8		   vs 39.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 14.2		   vs 12.88</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 21.38		  vs 19.43</p>
<p> Pretax preexcept	 374.1		  vs 308.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   3.35 bln	     vs 2.97 bln</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 361.4 and 380.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Scottish and Newcastle Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
